// ==========================================================
// Version 1.0: BG1 COMPANION STARTING PROVISIONS (OPTIONAL)
// Preserves BG1 / SoD / SoA / ToB and container components.
// Touches only BG1 and BGEE low-level recruiting CRE resources.
// All additions are identified, stackable, placed only in unused
// backpack slots: NOMOVE prevents displacement or deletion.
// ==========================================================
// Former WeiDU component: Miscellaneous Merchants - Part VI: BG1 Companion Starting Provisions (15 NPCs)

// Important: no BG2/SoD high-level CREs are patched.
// For stackable custom items, charge1 is the stack quantity.
// Vanilla companion items, portraits, levels, scripts, classes
// and memorized/known spells are left untouched.

// Xzar: QCWATER x2, QCSAUSG x1
ACTION_IF FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~XZAR.CRE~ BEGIN
  COPY_EXISTING ~XZAR.CRE~ ~override~
    ADD_CRE_ITEM ~QCWATER~ #2 #0 #0 ~IDENTIFIED~ ~INV QITEM~ NOMOVE
    ADD_CRE_ITEM ~QCSAUSG~ #1 #0 #0 ~IDENTIFIED~ ~INV QITEM~ NOMOVE
END

ACTION_IF FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~XZAR2.CRE~ BEGIN
  COPY_EXISTING ~XZAR2.CRE~ ~override~
    ADD_CRE_ITEM ~QCWATER~ #2 #0 #0 ~IDENTIFIED~ ~INV QITEM~ NOMOVE
    ADD_CRE_ITEM ~QCSAUSG~ #1 #0 #0 ~IDENTIFIED~ ~INV QITEM~ NOMOVE
END

